Now we need to check that we didn't accidentally try to attach_task_profile again after we already attached; we only do once.

Now we need to check that we didn't try to confirm_candidate_preparedness again after it's true; we only do once.

Now we need to check that we didn't try to assign_operator_resource again after we released; we assign only once per candidate.

Now we need to check that we didn't try to assign_skill_certificate again after we released; we assign only once per candidate.

Now we need to check that we didn't try to assign_compliance_certificate again after we released; we assign only once per candidate.

