Now we need to check that we didn't try to establish_clearance_nominal again after it's established; we only do once.

Now we need to check that we didn't try to finalize_candidate_direct again after it's finalized; we only do once.

Now we need to check that we didn't try to allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate again after it's allocated; we only do once per candidate.

Now we need to check that we didn't try to execute_*_dispatch again after it's dispatched; we only do once.

